{"id":"homicidio","lemma":"homicidio","pos":"noun","rank":1539,"glosses":["homicide; manslaughter"],"ipa":"/omiˈθidjo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"homicidios"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/0d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-homicidio.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Quién cometió este homicidio?","en":"Who committed this murder?"},{"text":"Él fue arrestado por homicidio.","en":"He was arrested for murder."},{"text":"Tom era sospechoso de homicidio.","en":"Tom was suspected of murder."},{"text":"Lo acusaron de homicidio involuntario.","en":"They accused him of manslaughter."},{"text":"Él fue encontrado culpable de homicidio.","en":"He was found guilty of murder."}]}